title: "Embodied Null Probes: Embodied Negative Controls for Low-Disturbance Robot Self-Diagnosis"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Embodied Null Probes contributors"
abstract: "A reproducible simulation study of paired, nominally cancelling robot actions as embodied negative controls for diagnosing hidden actuator and contact changes under task-disturbance constraints."
